<SiteLayout title="About Rishav and Anuj | Agenquest" description="Meet the founders of Agenquest and learn how we approach customer research, tailored AEO strategy, hands-on implementation, and measurement." wide={false}>
<div class="reading-wrap about-copy"><h1>We're Rishav and Anuj. We're building Agenquest.</h1>
<p>We met at IIT Bombay and stayed interested in how technology changes the way people make decisions. Agenquest grew out of a question: as more discovery happens through AI, what should a business actually do differently?</p>
<p>Our backgrounds are in strategy, analytics, and financial software. We're bringing that experience to customer research, practical AEO work, and careful measurement.</p>
<h3>Rishav Jain</h3><p><strong>Co-founder</strong></p><p>Rishav brings experience in strategy and analytics. His focus at Agenquest is understanding the business problem, asking useful customer questions, and turning research into priorities a team can act on.</p>
<h3>Anuj Kumar Sinha</h3><p><strong>Co-founder</strong></p><p>Anuj brings experience building enterprise solutions and driving growth marketing. His focus at Agenquest is connecting the strategy to practical implementation and repeatable ways of doing the work.</p>
<h3>How we want to work</h3>
<p>You'll work directly with us. We'll explain what we observed, what we think it means, and what we want to test. If the evidence changes, the plan should change too.</p>
<p>We're an early company, and we're looking for clients who value that close working relationship. We don't have a long client list to put on this page. We do have independent research you can read and a clear way to start a conversation.</p>
<p class="action-row"><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">Read our research →</a><a class="button" href="/contact/">Get my free AEO plan</a></p>
<h3>What you can expect from us</h3><ul><li>A strategy built around your customers and business goals.</li><li>Clear scope, costs, and responsibilities before paid work.</li><li>Hands-on help with agreed implementation.</li><li>Honest reporting, including results that don't support our initial hypothesis.</li><li>Respect for genuine reviews, independent judgment, and the communities we work in.</li></ul>
<h3>Let's see if there's useful work to do.</h3><p>The first call is free. Share your website and we'll come prepared with initial findings and questions.</p>
<p class="action-row"><a class="button" href="/contact/">Get my free AEO plan</a></p></div>
</SiteLayout>
